Goodix 27c6:5125 — licensing map

This repository is multi-licensed. Each source file retains its own copyright
notices and license; no single blanket license replaces those terms.

* Goodix driver sources under libfprint-driver/: per-file SPDX identifiers,
  predominantly LGPL-2.1-or-later. The image-preprocessing files under
  libfprint-driver/rockytkg-imgproc/ retain GPL-2.0-or-later.
* SIGFM source under Rockytkg/libfprint/libfprint/sigfm/: LGPL-2.1-or-later,
  with the original contributor notices preserved.
* The Fedora libfprint source base under reference/: original upstream
  per-file terms, predominantly LGPL-2.1-or-later.
* Project installation, build, recovery and Plasma Login selector code:
  GPL-2.0-or-later, as stated by each file.
* Earlier project-authored revisions that were distributed under BSD-2-Clause
  remain available under the grant accompanying those revisions. That prior
  grant is not revoked; its license text is in LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt.
* Third-party works retain their stated licenses. Open-source grants here do
  not license OEM binaries, reader secrets, captures or biometric data.

The Goodix-enabled libfprint-2.so.2.0.0 combines source available under
LGPL-2.1-or-later and GPL-2.0-or-later and links Apache-2.0 components. The
combined binary is conveyed under GPL-3.0-or-later, as permitted by the
applicable later-version grants. Individual source files retain their own
notices and licenses; GPL source is not relicensed as LGPL.

Canonical license texts are in LICENSES/. Per-component origins, downstream
changes and distribution requirements are in docs/LICENSING_AND_PROVENANCE.md.
